      <h3>Where can I download iRogue?</h3>
      <P> The current version of iRogue is: 0.40.
      <P> <a href="iRogue.zip">
      Download iRogue.zip</a>
      <P> Unzip and install iRogue.prc.  You might also like to read
the <a href="play.html">instructions</a> for how to play.

      <h3>System requirements</h3>

      <P> iRogue will take about 110 K.
      <P> iRogue will not work on a Pilot 1000 or a Pilot 5000.  (Your
OS must be 2 or higher.)  Sorry.
      
      <h3>Note</h3>

      <P> If you have a version of this game that is earlier than
v0.40, you know that there used to be two files iRogue.prc and
iRogue_Library.prc.  The game is now one file (because we are at last
compiling with prc-tools 2.0 and multigen), so you can delete the old
Library from your PalmPilot as soon as you install the new iRogue.prc.
      
